2| * Procedural Berlin-style city generator.
3| *
4| * PURE DATA: no DOM, no WebGL. Takes a seed, returns a plain object that the
5| * mesh builder turns into geometry and the physics uses for collisions.
6| * Runs in Node too, which is how the tests exercise it.
