10| *   |  park  | altbau | altbau | ...   <- block rows separated by streets
11| *   ===[gate]==== Unter den Linden ===   <- boulevard with a linden-tree median
12| *   |  park  | altbau | plaza(TV tower)
13| *   ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~ Spree ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~   <- river row, crossed by bridges
14| *   | altbau | platte | altbau | ...
